<title>USA: Incyte, OncorMed to collaborate.</title>
<headline>Incyte, OncorMed to collaborate.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, Calif. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Incyte Pharmaceuticals Inc said Tuesday it had formed a collaboration with OncorMed Inc in clinical genomics, and as part of the agreement will acquire 10 percent of OncorMed's shares.</p>
<p>Incyte will invest $3 million in OncorMed stock, and receive more shares in exchange for a license to use Incyte's high-throughput sequencing technology.</p>
<p>Incyte will also receive a warrant that would allow it to acquire an additional 10 percent of OncorMed's stock.</p>
<p>Incyte said the collaboration allows it to broaden its scope beyond research into the clinical area.</p>
<p>OncorMed develops gene-based cancer diagnostic and information services. Incyte develops genomic database products and software tools.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
